From: miuicamera-cupid
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] Enable GPU Leica Authentic engine (CvStyleFilterRender) on non-Leica HALs

Pre-Leica SM8450 HALs (such as cupid) do not implement the vendor session tag
`com.xiaomi.sessionparams.stylizationType`. MiuiCamera 6.2 includes a built-in
GPU Leica Authentic pipeline (`CvStyleFilterRender` + `CvShadingRender` +
`lut_cvstyle_*` LUTs), gated by:
1. `device_common.l3()` (classes3.dex @ 0x7303e8): returned `this instanceof fuxi`.
2. `pb.d0.a1()` (classes2.dex @ 0x8312b0): defaulted `pb_leica_key` to `true`,
   skipping the GPU LUT pipeline in `Camera2Module` and `AiSceneManager`.

--- a/classes3.dex (device_common.l3:()Z @ 0x7303e8)
+++ b/classes3.dex (device_common.l3:()Z @ 0x7303e8)
@@ -1,2 +1,3 @@
-    instance-of v0, v0, Lfuxi;     # 2000 3b23
+    const/4 v0, 0x1                # 1210
+    nop                            # 0000
     return v0

--- a/classes2.dex (pb.d0.a1:()Z @ 0x8312b0)
+++ b/classes2.dex (pb.d0.a1:()Z @ 0x8312b0)
@@ -1 +1 @@
-    const/4 v2, 0x1                # 1212 (default pb_leica_key = true)
+    const/4 v2, 0x0                # 1202 (default pb_leica_key = false)
